# Governance Scope

- Inspect before editing and preserve unrelated user changes.
- Treat workflow, hook, MCP, security, and release changes as high-risk.
- Prefer deterministic local checks over external automation.
- Do not add production debug instrumentation or localhost telemetry.
- Keep rules and skills focused; avoid duplicating policy across instruction layers.
- Fail closed for release and security invariants; fail open for informational checks.
- Use Cloudflare MCP servers only for Cloudflare-specific tasks.
